---

  <!-- Page Hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      {% set breadcrumbs = [{url: "/about/", label: "About Us"}, {label: "How We're Funded"}] %}
      {% include "partials/breadcrumb.njk" %}
      <h1>How We're Funded</h1>
      <p>Manchester LMC is funded entirely by the GPs and practices it represents — with no government subsidy or commercial income.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Intro -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-2" style="align-items: start;">
        <div>
          <h2>Independent Funding, Independent Voice</h2>
          <p>As a statutory body under the National Health Service Act 2006, Manchester LMC must be financially independent of NHS England and ICBs. This independence is essential — it means we can represent GPs robustly, without fear or favour, even when that means challenging commissioners or government policy.</p>
          <p>Our funding comes from a statutory levy on GMS practices, with PMS and APMS practices contributing on a voluntary basis, alongside a voluntary subscription for locum and portfolio GPs. Both are modest, transparent, and set by the elected committee.</p>
          <p>We occasionally receive sponsorship from pharmaceutical companies for specific events, which is declared openly. We hold no commercial conflicts of interest.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="padding: 2rem;">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: var(--colour-primary);">At a Glance</h3>
          <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem;">
            <li style="display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; align-items: flex-start;">
              <span style="flex-shrink:0; width:32px; height:32px; background: var(--colour-accent); border-radius: 50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color: white;">
                {% icon "check", 16 %}
              </span>
              <span><strong>Statutory levy</strong> on GMS practices; voluntary for PMS and APMS practices</span>
            </li>
            <li style="display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; align-items: flex-start;">
              <span style="flex-shrink:0; width:32px; height:32px; background: var(--colour-accent); border-radius: 50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color: white;">
                {% icon "check", 16 %}
              </span>
              <span><strong>£100/year</strong> voluntary subscription for locums and portfolio GPs</span>
            </li>
            <li style="display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; align-items: flex-start;">
              <span style="flex-shrink:0; width:32px; height:32px; background: var(--colour-accent); border-radius: 50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color: white;">
                {% icon "check", 16 %}
              </span>
              <span><strong>Event sponsorship</strong> from pharmaceutical companies, declared openly</span>
            </li>
            <li style="display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; align-items: flex-start;">
              <span style="flex-shrink:0; width:32px; height:32px; background: var(--colour-accent); border-radius: 50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color: white;">
                {% icon "check", 16 %}
              </span>
              <span><strong>Accounts published</strong> annually via the LMC Annual Report</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Levy model -->
  <section class="section" style="background: var(--colour-neutral);">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="text-center" style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">The Practice Levy</h2>
      <p class="text-center" style="color: var(--colour-muted); max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto 3rem;">Every GP GMS Practice holding an NHS contract in Manchester contributes to the LMC through a statutory levy — an obligation set by national legislation.</p>

      <div class="grid-3" style="gap: 2rem;">
        <div class="card" style="text-align: center; padding: 2rem;">
          <div style="width: 64px; height: 64px; background: var(--colour-primary); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin: 0 auto 1rem; color: white;">
            {% icon "users", 28 %}
          </div>
          <h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.5rem;">Who Pays</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--colour-muted); margin: 0;">The statutory levy applies to GMS practices only; PMS and APMS practices within the Manchester area contribute on a voluntary basis. The levy is calculated in relation to the registered list size.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="text-align: center; padding: 2rem;">
          <div style="width: 64px; height: 64px; background: var(--colour-primary); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin: 0 auto 1rem; color: white;">
            {% icon "settings", 28 %}
          </div>
          <h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.5rem;">How It's Set</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--colour-muted); margin: 0;">The levy rate is agreed each year by the elected LMC committee and published in our Annual Report.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="text-align: center; padding: 2rem;">
          <div style="width: 64px; height: 64px; background: var(--colour-primary); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; margin: 0 auto 1rem; color: white;">
            {% icon "shield", 28 %}
          </div>
          <h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.5rem;">What It Funds</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--colour-muted); margin: 0;">Staffing, committee meetings, representation at local, regional, and national meetings and events, and the maintenance of guidance, news, and member services for all practices.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Locum subscription -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-2" style="align-items: center; gap: 3rem;">
        <div>
          <span class="badge badge--accent" style="margin-bottom: 1rem; display: inline-block;">Locum &amp; Portfolio GPs</span>
          <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">Voluntary Subscription</h2>
          <p>Locum GPs, portfolio GPs, and those not working within a contracted practice are not covered by the practice levy — but they still have access to everything Manchester LMC offers, including confidential advisory services, wellbeing support, and access to our guidance library.</p>
          <p>To support this, we offer a voluntary annual subscription of <strong>£100 per year</strong>. Subscribers receive full member benefits:</p>
          <ul style="color: var(--colour-text); line-height: 2;">
            <li>Access to the subscriber-only area (agenda papers, meeting minutes, open forum)</li>
            <li>Confidential advisory support from the Managing Director</li>
            <li>Representation at the LMC and at national conferences</li>
            <li>Regular newsletters and updates</li>
            <li>Access to all guidance documents and resources</li>
            <li>Invitation to LMC meetings and events</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/members/#register" class="btn btn--accent" style="margin-top: 1rem;">Register as a Subscriber</a>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="card" style="padding: 2rem; border-left: 4px solid var(--colour-accent);">
            <p style="font-size: 3rem; font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 700; color: var(--colour-accent); margin: 0 0 0.25rem;">£100</p>
            <p style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--colour-primary); margin: 0 0 1rem;">per year</p>
            <p style="color: var(--colour-muted); margin: 0 0 1.5rem;">Full member access for locum and portfolio GPs not covered by the practice levy.</p>
            <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 1.5rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; color: var(--colour-text); font-size: 0.9rem;">
              <li>✓ &nbsp;Subscriber area access</li>
              <li>✓ &nbsp;Confidential advisory service</li>
              <li>✓ &nbsp;Guidance library</li>
              <li>✓ &nbsp;Newsletters &amp; updates</li>
              <li>✓ &nbsp;Meeting invitations</li>
              <li>✓ &nbsp;National conference representation</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="/members/#register" class="btn btn--primary" style="width: 100%; text-align: center;">Register Now</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Accountability -->
  <section class="section" style="background: var(--colour-neutral);">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="text-center" style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Accountability &amp; Transparency</h2>
      <p class="text-center" style="color: var(--colour-muted); max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto 3rem;">We are accountable to our member practices. Our finances are reviewed annually and our committee is democratically elected.</p>

      <div class="grid-2" style="gap: 2rem; align-items: start;">
        <div>
          <h3>Annual Report</h3>
          <p>Manchester LMC publishes an Annual Report each year, setting out our accounts, committee activity, and the levy rate for the coming year.</p>
          <p>The Annual Report is shared with all member practices and available via the <a href="/members/">Members Area</a>, or on request.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Committee Elections</h3>
          <p>The LMC committee consists of elected GP representatives. Seats are allocated to reflect the diversity of practice types within our patch.</p>
          <p>Elections are held in accordance with the Constitution. Committee members serve a fixed term and may stand for re-election.</p>
          <p>Current committee members are listed on our <a href="/about/team/">LMC Officers and Executive</a> page.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Constitution and Standing Orders -->
  {# TODO: to be confirmed — this section may need to be restricted to members-only access #}
  <section class="section" id="constitution">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <h2>Our Constitution and Standing Orders</h2>
        <p>Manchester LMC operates in accordance with a written constitution and standing orders that set out our statutory basis, the composition and election of the committee, meeting procedures, financial governance, and the rights of member practices.</p>
        <p>The constitution was last updated in 2022 in line with changes to NHS organisational structures following the Health and Care Act 2022 and the formation of Greater Manchester Integrated Care Board.</p>

        <div class="doc-card" style="margin: 2rem 0;">
          <div class="doc-card__icon doc-card__icon--pdf" aria-hidden="true">
            {% icon "file-text", 24 %}
          </div>
          <div class="doc-card__body">
            <h3 class="doc-card__title">Manchester LMC Constitution and Standing Orders</h3>
            <div class="doc-card__meta">
